{"id":"069c67d72b4fb710","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-epsilon-0-notation.md","title":"df epsilon 0 notation","display":"df epsilon 0 notation","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-epsilon-0-notation","aliases":["72-df-epsilon-0-notation"],"display":"df epsilon 0 notation","depends_on":["[[72-df-epsilon-0]]","[[72-df-cantor-normal-form]]","[[72-df-primitive-recursive-program]]"],"source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.IV §2.1 ordinal terms; local finite-CNF syntax and explicit effective encoding","verification_status":"reviewed-definition","proof_status":"definition-well-defined","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-epsilon-0-notation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-epsilon-0-notation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df epsilon 0 notation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"446dc4361d624e0f\" href=\"?note=446dc4361d624e0f\" title=\"72-df-epsilon-0\">72-df-epsilon-0</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"eaeefe0a6812ba97\" href=\"?note=eaeefe0a6812ba97\" title=\"72-df-cantor-normal-form\">72-df-cantor-normal-form</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"1a814f5220a079de\" href=\"?note=1a814f5220a079de\" title=\"72-df-primitive-recursive-program\">72-df-primitive-recursive-program</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.IV §2.1 ordinal terms; local finite-CNF syntax and explicit effective encoding"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"reviewed-definition"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"definition-well-defined"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>元理论为 ZFC。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal H\">\\(\\mathcal H\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\triangleleft\">\\(\\triangleleft\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{OT}_{\\varepsilon_0}\">\\(\\operatorname{OT}_{\\varepsilon_0}\\)</span> 由下列有限阶段和树递归给出；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a,b\">\\(a,b\\)</span> 是有限嵌套列表，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a_i\">\\(a_i\\)</span> 为其第 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\">\\(i\\)</span> 个子项。比较递归按两棵树大小之和下降，赋值 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v\">\\(v\\)</span> 使用序数和与序数幂。重复指数允许；空列表记 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0_\\varepsilon\">\\(0_\\varepsilon\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PRProg},Z,S,P,\\operatorname{Comp},\\operatorname{Rec},\\operatorname{ar},⟦\\cdot⟧\">\\(\\operatorname{PRProg},Z,S,P,\\operatorname{Comp},\\operatorname{Rec},\\operatorname{ar},⟦\\cdot⟧\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"1a814f5220a079de\" href=\"?note=1a814f5220a079de\" title=\"72-df-primitive-recursive-program\">72-df-primitive-recursive-program</a>，递归参数位于最后。以下全部 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{sans\\ serif}\">\\(\\mathsf{sans\\ serif}\\)</span> 小写程序名仅在本节点局部使用；每次命名均为一个确定的 PR 程序树，不按外延相等合并程序。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec u\">\\(\\vec u\\)</span> 是互异的有限变量标签序列。编译表达式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E_{\\vec u}\">\\(\\mathcal E_{\\vec u}\\)</span> 的构造子为变量、自然常量 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\underline k\">\\(\\underline k\\)</span> 和已定程序的应用；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c(e_0,\\ldots,e_{m-1})\">\\(c(e_0,\\ldots,e_{m-1})\\)</span> 是带程序标签 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\">\\(c\\)</span> 的应用节点。编译括号内的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0,1,2\">\\(0,1,2\\)</span> 分别缩写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\underline0,\\underline1,\\underline2\">\\(\\underline0,\\underline1,\\underline2\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[e]_{\\vec u}\">\\([e]_{\\vec u}\\)</span> 的形式编译在 Assertion 给出。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma(c),\\Pi(c),M(c)\">\\(\\Sigma(c),\\Pi(c),M(c)\\)</span> 只用于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ar}(c)=n+1\">\\(\\operatorname{ar}(c)=n+1\\)</span>，结果元数也是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n+1\">\\(n+1\\)</span>；最后输入为界，分别计算有界和、有界积、有界最小非零值位置，未找到时返回界。</li>\n<li>先给出算术辅助程序，再用素数幂保存有限布尔表。表状态 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{state}(k)\">\\(\\mathsf{state}(k)\\)</span> 只保存下标 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"&lt;k\">\\(&lt;k\\)</span> 的值；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{lookup}\">\\(\\mathsf{lookup}\\)</span> 对尚不存在的位置返回 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p_i:=⟦\\mathsf{prime}⟧(i)\">\\(p_i:=⟦\\mathsf{prime}⟧(i)\\)</span> 是第 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\">\\(i\\)</span> 个素数，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p_0=2\">\\(p_0=2\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d_\\varepsilon,r_\\varepsilon,e_\\varepsilon,e_{&lt;a}\">\\(d_\\varepsilon,r_\\varepsilon,e_\\varepsilon,e_{&lt;a}\\)</span> 均是下式固定的程序或程序对；没有另行选择实现同一外延函数的程序。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal H_0&amp;:=\\{()\\},\\qquad\\mathcal H_{j+1}:=\\mathcal H_j\\cup\\bigcup_{k\\in\\omega}\\mathcal H_j^k,\\qquad\\mathcal H:=\\bigcup_{j\\in\\omega}\\mathcal H_j,\\\\\n\\operatorname{sz}(())&amp;:=1,\\qquad\\operatorname{sz}((a_i)_{i&lt;k}):=1+\\sum_{i&lt;k}\\operatorname{sz}(a_i),\\\\\na\\triangleleft b&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\bigl(|a|&lt;|b|\\land\\forall i&lt;|a|\\ (a_i=b_i)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\lor\\exists j&lt;\\min(|a|,|b|)\\ \\bigl((\\forall i&lt;j\\ (a_i=b_i))\\land a_j\\triangleleft b_j\\bigr),\\\\\n\\mathcal O_0&amp;:=\\{()\\},\\quad\\mathcal O_{j+1}:=\\mathcal O_j\\cup\\{(a_i)_{i&lt;k}:k\\in\\omega,\\ \\vec a\\in\\mathcal O_j^k,\\ \\forall i+1&lt;k\\ \\neg(a_i\\triangleleft a_{i+1})\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{OT}_{\\varepsilon_0}&amp;:=\\bigcup_{j\\in\\omega}\\mathcal O_j,\\qquad0_\\varepsilon:=(),\\\\\nv(())&amp;:=0,\\quad v((a_i)_{i&lt;k}):=\\sum_{i&lt;k}\\omega^{v(a_i)},\\\\\nc(())&amp;:=1,\\quad c((a_i)_{i&lt;k}):=\\prod_{i&lt;k}p_i^{c(a_i)+1},\\\\\nD_\\varepsilon&amp;:=\\{c(a):a\\in\\operatorname{OT}_{\\varepsilon_0}\\},\\qquad R_\\varepsilon:=\\{\\langle c(a),c(b)\\rangle:a,b\\in\\operatorname{OT}_{\\varepsilon_0},\\ a\\triangleleft b\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal H_0&amp;:=\\{()\\},\\qquad\\mathcal H_{j+1}:=\\mathcal H_j\\cup\\bigcup_{k\\in\\omega}\\mathcal H_j^k,\\qquad\\mathcal H:=\\bigcup_{j\\in\\omega}\\mathcal H_j,\\\\\n\\operatorname{sz}(())&amp;:=1,\\qquad\\operatorname{sz}((a_i)_{i&lt;k}):=1+\\sum_{i&lt;k}\\operatorname{sz}(a_i),\\\\\na\\triangleleft b&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\bigl(|a|&lt;|b|\\land\\forall i&lt;|a|\\ (a_i=b_i)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\lor\\exists j&lt;\\min(|a|,|b|)\\ \\bigl((\\forall i&lt;j\\ (a_i=b_i))\\land a_j\\triangleleft b_j\\bigr),\\\\\n\\mathcal O_0&amp;:=\\{()\\},\\quad\\mathcal O_{j+1}:=\\mathcal O_j\\cup\\{(a_i)_{i&lt;k}:k\\in\\omega,\\ \\vec a\\in\\mathcal O_j^k,\\ \\forall i+1&lt;k\\ \\neg(a_i\\triangleleft a_{i+1})\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{OT}_{\\varepsilon_0}&amp;:=\\bigcup_{j\\in\\omega}\\mathcal O_j,\\qquad0_\\varepsilon:=(),\\\\\nv(())&amp;:=0,\\quad v((a_i)_{i&lt;k}):=\\sum_{i&lt;k}\\omega^{v(a_i)},\\\\\nc(())&amp;:=1,\\quad c((a_i)_{i&lt;k}):=\\prod_{i&lt;k}p_i^{c(a_i)+1},\\\\\nD_\\varepsilon&amp;:=\\{c(a):a\\in\\operatorname{OT}_{\\varepsilon_0}\\},\\qquad R_\\varepsilon:=\\{\\langle c(a),c(b)\\rangle:a,b\\in\\operatorname{OT}_{\\varepsilon_0},\\ a\\triangleleft b\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal E_{\\vec u}&amp;::=u_i\\ (i&lt;|\\vec u|)\\mid\\underline k\\ (k\\in\\omega)\\mid c(e_0,\\ldots,e_{m-1})\\ (c\\in\\operatorname{PRProg},\\ \\operatorname{ar}(c)=m),\\\\\nK(n,0)&amp;:=Z(n),\\qquad K(n,k+1):=\\operatorname{Comp}(n,1,S,\\langle K(n,k)\\rangle),\\\\\n[u_i]_{\\vec u}&amp;:=P(|\\vec u|,i),\\qquad[\\underline k]_{\\vec u}:=K(|\\vec u|,k),\\\\\n[c(e_0,\\ldots,e_{m-1})]_{\\vec u}&amp;:=\\operatorname{Comp}(|\\vec u|,m,c,\\langle[e_i]_{\\vec u}\\rangle_{i&lt;m}),\\\\\n\\mathsf{add}&amp;:=\\operatorname{Rec}(1,P(1,0),[S(z)]_{x,y,z}),\\\\\n\\mathsf{mul}&amp;:=\\operatorname{Rec}(1,Z(1),[\\mathsf{add}(x,z)]_{x,y,z}),\\\\\n\\mathsf{pred}&amp;:=\\operatorname{Rec}(0,Z(0),P(2,0)),\\\\\n\\mathsf{sub}&amp;:=\\operatorname{Rec}(1,P(1,0),[\\mathsf{pred}(z)]_{x,y,z}),\\\\\n\\mathsf{not}&amp;:=\\operatorname{Rec}(0,K(0,1),Z(2)),\\quad\\mathsf{nz}:=[\\mathsf{not}(\\mathsf{not}(x))]_x,\\\\\n\\mathsf{lt}&amp;:=[\\mathsf{nz}(\\mathsf{sub}(y,x))]_{x,y},\\quad\\mathsf{eq}:=[\\mathsf{not}(\\mathsf{add}(\\mathsf{sub}(x,y),\\mathsf{sub}(y,x)))]_{x,y},\\\\\n\\mathsf{min}&amp;:=[\\mathsf{sub}(x,\\mathsf{sub}(x,y))]_{x,y},\\\\\n\\mathsf{if}&amp;:=[\\mathsf{add}(\\mathsf{mul}(\\mathsf{nz}(b),x),\\mathsf{mul}(\\mathsf{not}(b),y))]_{b,x,y}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal E_{\\vec u}&amp;::=u_i\\ (i&lt;|\\vec u|)\\mid\\underline k\\ (k\\in\\omega)\\mid c(e_0,\\ldots,e_{m-1})\\ (c\\in\\operatorname{PRProg},\\ \\operatorname{ar}(c)=m),\\\\\nK(n,0)&amp;:=Z(n),\\qquad K(n,k+1):=\\operatorname{Comp}(n,1,S,\\langle K(n,k)\\rangle),\\\\\n[u_i]_{\\vec u}&amp;:=P(|\\vec u|,i),\\qquad[\\underline k]_{\\vec u}:=K(|\\vec u|,k),\\\\\n[c(e_0,\\ldots,e_{m-1})]_{\\vec u}&amp;:=\\operatorname{Comp}(|\\vec u|,m,c,\\langle[e_i]_{\\vec u}\\rangle_{i&lt;m}),\\\\\n\\mathsf{add}&amp;:=\\operatorname{Rec}(1,P(1,0),[S(z)]_{x,y,z}),\\\\\n\\mathsf{mul}&amp;:=\\operatorname{Rec}(1,Z(1),[\\mathsf{add}(x,z)]_{x,y,z}),\\\\\n\\mathsf{pred}&amp;:=\\operatorname{Rec}(0,Z(0),P(2,0)),\\\\\n\\mathsf{sub}&amp;:=\\operatorname{Rec}(1,P(1,0),[\\mathsf{pred}(z)]_{x,y,z}),\\\\\n\\mathsf{not}&amp;:=\\operatorname{Rec}(0,K(0,1),Z(2)),\\quad\\mathsf{nz}:=[\\mathsf{not}(\\mathsf{not}(x))]_x,\\\\\n\\mathsf{lt}&amp;:=[\\mathsf{nz}(\\mathsf{sub}(y,x))]_{x,y},\\quad\\mathsf{eq}:=[\\mathsf{not}(\\mathsf{add}(\\mathsf{sub}(x,y),\\mathsf{sub}(y,x)))]_{x,y},\\\\\n\\mathsf{min}&amp;:=[\\mathsf{sub}(x,\\mathsf{sub}(x,y))]_{x,y},\\\\\n\\mathsf{if}&amp;:=[\\mathsf{add}(\\mathsf{mul}(\\mathsf{nz}(b),x),\\mathsf{mul}(\\mathsf{not}(b),y))]_{b,x,y}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{ar}(c)=n+1\\ \\Longrightarrow\\quad\n\\Sigma(c)&amp;:=\\operatorname{Rec}(n,Z(n),[\\mathsf{add}(z,c(\\vec x,y))]_{\\vec x,y,z}),\\\\\n\\Pi(c)&amp;:=\\operatorname{Rec}(n,K(n,1),[\\mathsf{mul}(z,c(\\vec x,y))]_{\\vec x,y,z}),\\\\\nN(c)&amp;:=\\operatorname{Rec}(n,K(n,1),[\\mathsf{mul}(z,\\mathsf{not}(c(\\vec x,y)))]_{\\vec x,y,z}),\\\\\nM(c)&amp;:=\\operatorname{Rec}(n,Z(n),[\\mathsf{add}(z,N(c)(\\vec x,S(y)))]_{\\vec x,y,z}),\\qquad |\\vec x|=n.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{ar}(c)=n+1\\ \\Longrightarrow\\quad\n\\Sigma(c)&amp;:=\\operatorname{Rec}(n,Z(n),[\\mathsf{add}(z,c(\\vec x,y))]_{\\vec x,y,z}),\\\\\n\\Pi(c)&amp;:=\\operatorname{Rec}(n,K(n,1),[\\mathsf{mul}(z,c(\\vec x,y))]_{\\vec x,y,z}),\\\\\nN(c)&amp;:=\\operatorname{Rec}(n,K(n,1),[\\mathsf{mul}(z,\\mathsf{not}(c(\\vec x,y)))]_{\\vec x,y,z}),\\\\\nM(c)&amp;:=\\operatorname{Rec}(n,Z(n),[\\mathsf{add}(z,N(c)(\\vec x,S(y)))]_{\\vec x,y,z}),\\qquad |\\vec x|=n.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{pow}&amp;:=\\operatorname{Rec}(1,K(1,1),[\\mathsf{mul}(x,z)]_{x,y,z}),\\\\\n\\mathsf{fac}&amp;:=\\operatorname{Rec}(0,K(0,1),[\\mathsf{mul}(S(y),z)]_{y,z}),\\\\\n\\mathsf{div}&amp;:=[\\mathsf{mul}(\\mathsf{nz}(a),\\mathsf{nz}(\\Sigma([\\mathsf{eq}(\\mathsf{mul}(a,b),n)]_{a,n,b})(a,n,S(n))))]_{a,n},\\\\\n\\mathsf{isprime}&amp;:=[\\mathsf{mul}(\\mathsf{lt}(1,n),\\Pi([\\mathsf{not}(\\mathsf{mul}(\\mathsf{lt}(1,a),\\mathsf{div}(a,n)))]_{n,a})(n,n))]_n,\\\\\n\\mathsf{next}&amp;:=[\\mathsf{mul}(\\mathsf{lt}(a,b),\\mathsf{isprime}(b))]_{a,b},\\\\\n\\mathsf{prime}&amp;:=\\operatorname{Rec}(0,K(0,2),[M(\\mathsf{next})(z,S(S(\\mathsf{fac}(z))))]_{i,z}),\\\\\np_i&amp;:=⟦\\mathsf{prime}⟧(i),\\\\\n\\mathsf{val}&amp;:=[\\mathsf{if}(\\mathsf{mul}(\\mathsf{nz}(n),\\mathsf{lt}(1,p)),\\Sigma([\\mathsf{div}(\\mathsf{pow}(p,S(i)),n)]_{n,p,i})(n,p,n),0)]_{n,p},\\\\\n\\mathsf{len}&amp;:=[\\mathsf{mul}(\\mathsf{nz}(n),M([\\mathsf{not}(\\mathsf{div}(\\mathsf{prime}(i),n))]_{n,i})(n,S(n)))]_n,\\\\\n\\mathsf{child}&amp;:=[\\mathsf{if}(\\mathsf{lt}(i,\\mathsf{len}(n)),\\mathsf{pred}(\\mathsf{val}(n,\\mathsf{prime}(i))),0)]_{n,i},\\\\\n\\mathsf{shape}&amp;:=[\\mathsf{mul}(\\mathsf{eq}(n,\\Pi([\\mathsf{pow}(\\mathsf{prime}(i),\\mathsf{val}(n,\\mathsf{prime}(i)))]_{n,i})(n,\\mathsf{len}(n))),\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{34mm}\\Pi([\\mathsf{lt}(1,\\mathsf{val}(n,\\mathsf{prime}(i)))]_{n,i})(n,\\mathsf{len}(n)))]_n.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{pow}&amp;:=\\operatorname{Rec}(1,K(1,1),[\\mathsf{mul}(x,z)]_{x,y,z}),\\\\\n\\mathsf{fac}&amp;:=\\operatorname{Rec}(0,K(0,1),[\\mathsf{mul}(S(y),z)]_{y,z}),\\\\\n\\mathsf{div}&amp;:=[\\mathsf{mul}(\\mathsf{nz}(a),\\mathsf{nz}(\\Sigma([\\mathsf{eq}(\\mathsf{mul}(a,b),n)]_{a,n,b})(a,n,S(n))))]_{a,n},\\\\\n\\mathsf{isprime}&amp;:=[\\mathsf{mul}(\\mathsf{lt}(1,n),\\Pi([\\mathsf{not}(\\mathsf{mul}(\\mathsf{lt}(1,a),\\mathsf{div}(a,n)))]_{n,a})(n,n))]_n,\\\\\n\\mathsf{next}&amp;:=[\\mathsf{mul}(\\mathsf{lt}(a,b),\\mathsf{isprime}(b))]_{a,b},\\\\\n\\mathsf{prime}&amp;:=\\operatorname{Rec}(0,K(0,2),[M(\\mathsf{next})(z,S(S(\\mathsf{fac}(z))))]_{i,z}),\\\\\np_i&amp;:=⟦\\mathsf{prime}⟧(i),\\\\\n\\mathsf{val}&amp;:=[\\mathsf{if}(\\mathsf{mul}(\\mathsf{nz}(n),\\mathsf{lt}(1,p)),\\Sigma([\\mathsf{div}(\\mathsf{pow}(p,S(i)),n)]_{n,p,i})(n,p,n),0)]_{n,p},\\\\\n\\mathsf{len}&amp;:=[\\mathsf{mul}(\\mathsf{nz}(n),M([\\mathsf{not}(\\mathsf{div}(\\mathsf{prime}(i),n))]_{n,i})(n,S(n)))]_n,\\\\\n\\mathsf{child}&amp;:=[\\mathsf{if}(\\mathsf{lt}(i,\\mathsf{len}(n)),\\mathsf{pred}(\\mathsf{val}(n,\\mathsf{prime}(i))),0)]_{n,i},\\\\\n\\mathsf{shape}&amp;:=[\\mathsf{mul}(\\mathsf{eq}(n,\\Pi([\\mathsf{pow}(\\mathsf{prime}(i),\\mathsf{val}(n,\\mathsf{prime}(i)))]_{n,i})(n,\\mathsf{len}(n))),\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{34mm}\\Pi([\\mathsf{lt}(1,\\mathsf{val}(n,\\mathsf{prime}(i)))]_{n,i})(n,\\mathsf{len}(n)))]_n.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{tri}&amp;:=\\Sigma(S),\\qquad\\mathsf{pair}:=[\\mathsf{add}(\\mathsf{tri}(\\mathsf{add}(x,y)),y)]_{x,y},\\\\\n\\mathsf{row}_0&amp;:=[\\Sigma([\\mathsf{mul}(x,\\mathsf{eq}(\\mathsf{pair}(x,y),s))]_{s,x,y})(s,x,S(s))]_{s,x},\\\\\n\\mathsf{row}_1&amp;:=[\\Sigma([\\mathsf{mul}(y,\\mathsf{eq}(\\mathsf{pair}(x,y),s))]_{s,x,y})(s,x,S(s))]_{s,x},\\\\\n\\mathsf{fst}&amp;:=[\\Sigma(\\mathsf{row}_0)(s,S(s))]_s,\\quad\\mathsf{snd}:=[\\Sigma(\\mathsf{row}_1)(s,S(s))]_s,\\\\\n\\mathsf{half}&amp;:=[\\Sigma([\\mathsf{not}(\\mathsf{lt}(n,\\mathsf{mul}(2,S(i))))]_{n,i})(n,S(n))]_n,\\\\\n\\mathsf{odd}&amp;:=[\\mathsf{sub}(n,\\mathsf{mul}(2,\\mathsf{half}(n)))]_n,\\\\\n\\mathsf{di}&amp;:=[\\mathsf{mul}(2,n)]_n,\\quad\\mathsf{ri}:=[S(\\mathsf{mul}(2,\\mathsf{pair}(n,m)))]_{n,m},\\\\\n\\mathsf{lookup}&amp;:=[\\mathsf{pred}(\\mathsf{val}(b,\\mathsf{prime}(j)))]_{b,j},\\\\\n\\mathsf{allchild}&amp;:=[\\Pi([\\mathsf{lookup}(b,\\mathsf{di}(\\mathsf{child}(n,i)))]_{n,b,i})(n,b,\\mathsf{len}(n))]_{n,b},\\\\\n\\mathsf{ordered}&amp;:=[\\Pi([\\mathsf{not}(\\mathsf{lookup}(b,\\mathsf{ri}(\\mathsf{child}(n,i),\\mathsf{child}(n,S(i)))))]_{n,b,i})(n,b,\\mathsf{pred}(\\mathsf{len}(n)))]_{n,b},\\\\\n\\mathsf{ds}&amp;:=[\\mathsf{mul}(\\mathsf{shape}(n),\\mathsf{mul}(\\mathsf{allchild}(n,b),\\mathsf{ordered}(n,b)))]_{n,b},\\\\\n\\mathsf{pref}&amp;:=[\\Pi([\\mathsf{eq}(\\mathsf{child}(n,i),\\mathsf{child}(m,i))]_{n,m,i})(n,m,k)]_{n,m,k},\\\\\n\\mathsf{diff}&amp;:=[\\mathsf{mul}(\\mathsf{pref}(n,m,i),\\mathsf{lookup}(b,\\mathsf{ri}(\\mathsf{child}(n,i),\\mathsf{child}(m,i))))]_{n,m,b,i},\\\\\n\\mathsf{lex}&amp;:=[\\mathsf{nz}(\\mathsf{add}(\\mathsf{mul}(\\mathsf{lt}(\\mathsf{len}(n),\\mathsf{len}(m)),\\mathsf{pref}(n,m,\\mathsf{len}(n))),\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{38mm}\\Sigma(\\mathsf{diff})(n,m,b,\\mathsf{min}(\\mathsf{len}(n),\\mathsf{len}(m)))))]_{n,m,b},\\\\\n\\mathsf{rs}&amp;:=[\\mathsf{mul}(\\mathsf{lookup}(b,\\mathsf{di}(n)),\\mathsf{mul}(\\mathsf{lookup}(b,\\mathsf{di}(m)),\\mathsf{lex}(n,m,b)))]_{n,m,b},\\\\\n\\mathsf{step}&amp;:=[\\mathsf{if}(\\mathsf{odd}(k),\\mathsf{rs}(\\mathsf{fst}(\\mathsf{half}(k)),\\mathsf{snd}(\\mathsf{half}(k)),b),\\mathsf{ds}(\\mathsf{half}(k),b))]_{k,b},\\\\\n\\mathsf{state}&amp;:=\\operatorname{Rec}(0,K(0,1),[\\mathsf{mul}(b,\\mathsf{pow}(\\mathsf{prime}(k),S(\\mathsf{step}(k,b))))]_{k,b}),\\\\\n\\mathsf{bit}&amp;:=[\\mathsf{step}(k,\\mathsf{state}(k))]_k,\\qquad d_\\varepsilon:=[\\mathsf{bit}(\\mathsf{di}(n))]_n,\\qquad r_\\varepsilon:=[\\mathsf{bit}(\\mathsf{ri}(n,m))]_{n,m},\\\\\ne_\\varepsilon&amp;:=\\langle d_\\varepsilon,r_\\varepsilon\\rangle,\\qquad d_{&lt;a}:=[\\mathsf{mul}(d_\\varepsilon(n),r_\\varepsilon(n,\\underline{c(a)}))]_n,\\qquad e_{&lt;a}:=\\langle d_{&lt;a},r_\\varepsilon\\rangle\\quad(a\\in\\operatorname{OT}_{\\varepsilon_0}).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{tri}&amp;:=\\Sigma(S),\\qquad\\mathsf{pair}:=[\\mathsf{add}(\\mathsf{tri}(\\mathsf{add}(x,y)),y)]_{x,y},\\\\\n\\mathsf{row}_0&amp;:=[\\Sigma([\\mathsf{mul}(x,\\mathsf{eq}(\\mathsf{pair}(x,y),s))]_{s,x,y})(s,x,S(s))]_{s,x},\\\\\n\\mathsf{row}_1&amp;:=[\\Sigma([\\mathsf{mul}(y,\\mathsf{eq}(\\mathsf{pair}(x,y),s))]_{s,x,y})(s,x,S(s))]_{s,x},\\\\\n\\mathsf{fst}&amp;:=[\\Sigma(\\mathsf{row}_0)(s,S(s))]_s,\\quad\\mathsf{snd}:=[\\Sigma(\\mathsf{row}_1)(s,S(s))]_s,\\\\\n\\mathsf{half}&amp;:=[\\Sigma([\\mathsf{not}(\\mathsf{lt}(n,\\mathsf{mul}(2,S(i))))]_{n,i})(n,S(n))]_n,\\\\\n\\mathsf{odd}&amp;:=[\\mathsf{sub}(n,\\mathsf{mul}(2,\\mathsf{half}(n)))]_n,\\\\\n\\mathsf{di}&amp;:=[\\mathsf{mul}(2,n)]_n,\\quad\\mathsf{ri}:=[S(\\mathsf{mul}(2,\\mathsf{pair}(n,m)))]_{n,m},\\\\\n\\mathsf{lookup}&amp;:=[\\mathsf{pred}(\\mathsf{val}(b,\\mathsf{prime}(j)))]_{b,j},\\\\\n\\mathsf{allchild}&amp;:=[\\Pi([\\mathsf{lookup}(b,\\mathsf{di}(\\mathsf{child}(n,i)))]_{n,b,i})(n,b,\\mathsf{len}(n))]_{n,b},\\\\\n\\mathsf{ordered}&amp;:=[\\Pi([\\mathsf{not}(\\mathsf{lookup}(b,\\mathsf{ri}(\\mathsf{child}(n,i),\\mathsf{child}(n,S(i)))))]_{n,b,i})(n,b,\\mathsf{pred}(\\mathsf{len}(n)))]_{n,b},\\\\\n\\mathsf{ds}&amp;:=[\\mathsf{mul}(\\mathsf{shape}(n),\\mathsf{mul}(\\mathsf{allchild}(n,b),\\mathsf{ordered}(n,b)))]_{n,b},\\\\\n\\mathsf{pref}&amp;:=[\\Pi([\\mathsf{eq}(\\mathsf{child}(n,i),\\mathsf{child}(m,i))]_{n,m,i})(n,m,k)]_{n,m,k},\\\\\n\\mathsf{diff}&amp;:=[\\mathsf{mul}(\\mathsf{pref}(n,m,i),\\mathsf{lookup}(b,\\mathsf{ri}(\\mathsf{child}(n,i),\\mathsf{child}(m,i))))]_{n,m,b,i},\\\\\n\\mathsf{lex}&amp;:=[\\mathsf{nz}(\\mathsf{add}(\\mathsf{mul}(\\mathsf{lt}(\\mathsf{len}(n),\\mathsf{len}(m)),\\mathsf{pref}(n,m,\\mathsf{len}(n))),\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{38mm}\\Sigma(\\mathsf{diff})(n,m,b,\\mathsf{min}(\\mathsf{len}(n),\\mathsf{len}(m)))))]_{n,m,b},\\\\\n\\mathsf{rs}&amp;:=[\\mathsf{mul}(\\mathsf{lookup}(b,\\mathsf{di}(n)),\\mathsf{mul}(\\mathsf{lookup}(b,\\mathsf{di}(m)),\\mathsf{lex}(n,m,b)))]_{n,m,b},\\\\\n\\mathsf{step}&amp;:=[\\mathsf{if}(\\mathsf{odd}(k),\\mathsf{rs}(\\mathsf{fst}(\\mathsf{half}(k)),\\mathsf{snd}(\\mathsf{half}(k)),b),\\mathsf{ds}(\\mathsf{half}(k),b))]_{k,b},\\\\\n\\mathsf{state}&amp;:=\\operatorname{Rec}(0,K(0,1),[\\mathsf{mul}(b,\\mathsf{pow}(\\mathsf{prime}(k),S(\\mathsf{step}(k,b))))]_{k,b}),\\\\\n\\mathsf{bit}&amp;:=[\\mathsf{step}(k,\\mathsf{state}(k))]_k,\\qquad d_\\varepsilon:=[\\mathsf{bit}(\\mathsf{di}(n))]_n,\\qquad r_\\varepsilon:=[\\mathsf{bit}(\\mathsf{ri}(n,m))]_{n,m},\\\\\ne_\\varepsilon&amp;:=\\langle d_\\varepsilon,r_\\varepsilon\\rangle,\\qquad d_{&lt;a}:=[\\mathsf{mul}(d_\\varepsilon(n),r_\\varepsilon(n,\\underline{c(a)}))]_n,\\qquad e_{&lt;a}:=\\langle d_{&lt;a},r_\\varepsilon\\rangle\\quad(a\\in\\operatorname{OT}_{\\varepsilon_0}).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{ar}(d_\\varepsilon)&amp;=\\operatorname{ar}(d_{&lt;a})=1,\\qquad\\operatorname{ar}(r_\\varepsilon)=2,\\\\\n\\forall n\\in\\omega\\quad⟦ d_\\varepsilon⟧(n)&amp;=\\mathbf1_{n\\in D_\\varepsilon},\\\\\n\\forall n,m\\in\\omega\\quad⟦ r_\\varepsilon⟧(n,m)&amp;=\\mathbf1_{\\langle n,m\\rangle\\in R_\\varepsilon},\\\\\n\\forall a\\in\\operatorname{OT}_{\\varepsilon_0}\\ \\forall n\\in\\omega\\quad⟦ d_{&lt;a}⟧(n)&amp;=\\mathbf1_{\\exists b\\in\\operatorname{OT}_{\\varepsilon_0}\\ (n=c(b)\\land b\\triangleleft a)}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{ar}(d_\\varepsilon)&amp;=\\operatorname{ar}(d_{&lt;a})=1,\\qquad\\operatorname{ar}(r_\\varepsilon)=2,\\\\\n\\forall n\\in\\omega\\quad⟦ d_\\varepsilon⟧(n)&amp;=\\mathbf1_{n\\in D_\\varepsilon},\\\\\n\\forall n,m\\in\\omega\\quad⟦ r_\\varepsilon⟧(n,m)&amp;=\\mathbf1_{\\langle n,m\\rangle\\in R_\\varepsilon},\\\\\n\\forall a\\in\\operatorname{OT}_{\\varepsilon_0}\\ \\forall n\\in\\omega\\quad⟦ d_{&lt;a}⟧(n)&amp;=\\mathbf1_{\\exists b\\in\\operatorname{OT}_{\\varepsilon_0}\\ (n=c(b)\\land b\\triangleleft a)}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>有限树比较只调用严格较小的子树对；所有生成阶段、编码和程序选择均已进入 Assertion。程序编译只用既有 PRProg 的常量、投影、后继、复合及原始递归。M 在界内没有非零值时返回界；素数递归的搜索界来自阶乘加一，因此不会依赖无界最小化。</p>\n<p>布尔表以偶数位置记录域判定、奇数位置记录 Cantor 配对后的关系判定。合法父代码的子代码严格更小；相邻两个子代码 a,b 的父代码至少为 2<sup>(a+1)·3</sup>(b+1)，严格大于它们的 Cantor 配对值。因而 allchild、ordered 和 lex 所需的合法项比较值已在更早表位记录。对表下标归纳得到末尾特征函数等式。该固定实现不是“任取同外延 PR 程序”的约定；更换实现须另证理论内可用的表示等价。此处没有声称已用证明助手验证该程序或后续序数分析证明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-epsilon-0","status":"resolved","id":"446dc4361d624e0f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-epsilon-0]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-cantor-normal-form","status":"resolved","id":"eaeefe0a6812ba97","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-cantor-normal-form]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-primitive-recursive-program","status":"resolved","id":"1a814f5220a079de","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-primitive-recursive-program]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-primitive-recursive-program","status":"resolved","id":"1a814f5220a079de","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{PRProg},Z,S,P,\\operatorname{Comp},\\operatorname{Rec},\\operatorname{ar},⟦\\cdot⟧$ 取 [[72-df-primitive-recursive-program]]，递归参数位于最后。以下全部 $\\mathsf{sans\\ serif}$ 小写程序名仅在本节点局部使用；每次命名均为一个确定的 PR 程序树，不按外延相等合并程序。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal H","display":false},{"tex":"\\triangleleft","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{OT}_{\\varepsilon_0}","display":false},{"tex":"a,b","display":false},{"tex":"a_i","display":false},{"tex":"i","display":false},{"tex":"v","display":false},{"tex":"0_\\varepsilon","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{PRProg},Z,S,P,\\operatorname{Comp},\\operatorname{Rec},\\operatorname{ar},⟦\\cdot⟧","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{sans\\ serif}","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec u","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal E_{\\vec u}","display":false},{"tex":"\\underline k","display":false},{"tex":"c(e_0,\\ldots,e_{m-1})","display":false},{"tex":"c","display":false},{"tex":"0,1,2","display":false},{"tex":"\\underline0,\\underline1,\\underline2","display":false},{"tex":"[e]_{\\vec u}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma(c),\\Pi(c),M(c)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ar}(c)=n+1","display":false},{"tex":"n+1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{state}(k)","display":false},{"tex":"<k","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{lookup}","display":false},{"tex":"0","display":false},{"tex":"p_i:=⟦\\mathsf{prime}⟧(i)","display":false},{"tex":"i","display":false},{"tex":"p_0=2","display":false},{"tex":"d_\\varepsilon,r_\\varepsilon,e_\\varepsilon,e_{<a}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal H_0&:=\\{()\\},\\qquad\\mathcal H_{j+1}:=\\mathcal H_j\\cup\\bigcup_{k\\in\\omega}\\mathcal H_j^k,\\qquad\\mathcal H:=\\bigcup_{j\\in\\omega}\\mathcal H_j,\\\\\n\\operatorname{sz}(())&:=1,\\qquad\\operatorname{sz}((a_i)_{i<k}):=1+\\sum_{i<k}\\operatorname{sz}(a_i),\\\\\na\\triangleleft b&:\\Longleftrightarrow\\bigl(|a|<|b|\\land\\forall i<|a|\\ (a_i=b_i)\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\quad\\lor\\exists j<\\min(|a|,|b|)\\ \\bigl((\\forall i<j\\ (a_i=b_i))\\land a_j\\triangleleft b_j\\bigr),\\\\\n\\mathcal O_0&:=\\{()\\},\\quad\\mathcal O_{j+1}:=\\mathcal O_j\\cup\\{(a_i)_{i<k}:k\\in\\omega,\\ \\vec a\\in\\mathcal O_j^k,\\ \\forall i+1<k\\ \\neg(a_i\\triangleleft a_{i+1})\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{OT}_{\\varepsilon_0}&:=\\bigcup_{j\\in\\omega}\\mathcal O_j,\\qquad0_\\varepsilon:=(),\\\\\nv(())&:=0,\\quad v((a_i)_{i<k}):=\\sum_{i<k}\\omega^{v(a_i)},\\\\\nc(())&:=1,\\quad c((a_i)_{i<k}):=\\prod_{i<k}p_i^{c(a_i)+1},\\\\\nD_\\varepsilon&:=\\{c(a):a\\in\\operatorname{OT}_{\\varepsilon_0}\\},\\qquad R_\\varepsilon:=\\{\\langle c(a),c(b)\\rangle:a,b\\in\\operatorname{OT}_{\\varepsilon_0},\\ a\\triangleleft b\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal E_{\\vec u}&::=u_i\\ (i<|\\vec u|)\\mid\\underline k\\ (k\\in\\omega)\\mid c(e_0,\\ldots,e_{m-1})\\ (c\\in\\operatorname{PRProg},\\ \\operatorname{ar}(c)=m),\\\\\nK(n,0)&:=Z(n),\\qquad K(n,k+1):=\\operatorname{Comp}(n,1,S,\\langle K(n,k)\\rangle),\\\\\n[u_i]_{\\vec u}&:=P(|\\vec u|,i),\\qquad[\\underline k]_{\\vec u}:=K(|\\vec u|,k),\\\\\n[c(e_0,\\ldots,e_{m-1})]_{\\vec u}&:=\\operatorname{Comp}(|\\vec u|,m,c,\\langle[e_i]_{\\vec u}\\rangle_{i<m}),\\\\\n\\mathsf{add}&:=\\operatorname{Rec}(1,P(1,0),[S(z)]_{x,y,z}),\\\\\n\\mathsf{mul}&:=\\operatorname{Rec}(1,Z(1),[\\mathsf{add}(x,z)]_{x,y,z}),\\\\\n\\mathsf{pred}&:=\\operatorname{Rec}(0,Z(0),P(2,0)),\\\\\n\\mathsf{sub}&:=\\operatorname{Rec}(1,P(1,0),[\\mathsf{pred}(z)]_{x,y,z}),\\\\\n\\mathsf{not}&:=\\operatorname{Rec}(0,K(0,1),Z(2)),\\quad\\mathsf{nz}:=[\\mathsf{not}(\\mathsf{not}(x))]_x,\\\\\n\\mathsf{lt}&:=[\\mathsf{nz}(\\mathsf{sub}(y,x))]_{x,y},\\quad\\mathsf{eq}:=[\\mathsf{not}(\\mathsf{add}(\\mathsf{sub}(x,y),\\mathsf{sub}(y,x)))]_{x,y},\\\\\n\\mathsf{min}&:=[\\mathsf{sub}(x,\\mathsf{sub}(x,y))]_{x,y},\\\\\n\\mathsf{if}&:=[\\mathsf{add}(\\mathsf{mul}(\\mathsf{nz}(b),x),\\mathsf{mul}(\\mathsf{not}(b),y))]_{b,x,y}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{ar}(c)=n+1\\ \\Longrightarrow\\quad\n\\Sigma(c)&:=\\operatorname{Rec}(n,Z(n),[\\mathsf{add}(z,c(\\vec x,y))]_{\\vec x,y,z}),\\\\\n\\Pi(c)&:=\\operatorname{Rec}(n,K(n,1),[\\mathsf{mul}(z,c(\\vec x,y))]_{\\vec x,y,z}),\\\\\nN(c)&:=\\operatorname{Rec}(n,K(n,1),[\\mathsf{mul}(z,\\mathsf{not}(c(\\vec x,y)))]_{\\vec x,y,z}),\\\\\nM(c)&:=\\operatorname{Rec}(n,Z(n),[\\mathsf{add}(z,N(c)(\\vec x,S(y)))]_{\\vec x,y,z}),\\qquad |\\vec x|=n.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{pow}&:=\\operatorname{Rec}(1,K(1,1),[\\mathsf{mul}(x,z)]_{x,y,z}),\\\\\n\\mathsf{fac}&:=\\operatorname{Rec}(0,K(0,1),[\\mathsf{mul}(S(y),z)]_{y,z}),\\\\\n\\mathsf{div}&:=[\\mathsf{mul}(\\mathsf{nz}(a),\\mathsf{nz}(\\Sigma([\\mathsf{eq}(\\mathsf{mul}(a,b),n)]_{a,n,b})(a,n,S(n))))]_{a,n},\\\\\n\\mathsf{isprime}&:=[\\mathsf{mul}(\\mathsf{lt}(1,n),\\Pi([\\mathsf{not}(\\mathsf{mul}(\\mathsf{lt}(1,a),\\mathsf{div}(a,n)))]_{n,a})(n,n))]_n,\\\\\n\\mathsf{next}&:=[\\mathsf{mul}(\\mathsf{lt}(a,b),\\mathsf{isprime}(b))]_{a,b},\\\\\n\\mathsf{prime}&:=\\operatorname{Rec}(0,K(0,2),[M(\\mathsf{next})(z,S(S(\\mathsf{fac}(z))))]_{i,z}),\\\\\np_i&:=⟦\\mathsf{prime}⟧(i),\\\\\n\\mathsf{val}&:=[\\mathsf{if}(\\mathsf{mul}(\\mathsf{nz}(n),\\mathsf{lt}(1,p)),\\Sigma([\\mathsf{div}(\\mathsf{pow}(p,S(i)),n)]_{n,p,i})(n,p,n),0)]_{n,p},\\\\\n\\mathsf{len}&:=[\\mathsf{mul}(\\mathsf{nz}(n),M([\\mathsf{not}(\\mathsf{div}(\\mathsf{prime}(i),n))]_{n,i})(n,S(n)))]_n,\\\\\n\\mathsf{child}&:=[\\mathsf{if}(\\mathsf{lt}(i,\\mathsf{len}(n)),\\mathsf{pred}(\\mathsf{val}(n,\\mathsf{prime}(i))),0)]_{n,i},\\\\\n\\mathsf{shape}&:=[\\mathsf{mul}(\\mathsf{eq}(n,\\Pi([\\mathsf{pow}(\\mathsf{prime}(i),\\mathsf{val}(n,\\mathsf{prime}(i)))]_{n,i})(n,\\mathsf{len}(n))),\\\\\n&\\hspace{34mm}\\Pi([\\mathsf{lt}(1,\\mathsf{val}(n,\\mathsf{prime}(i)))]_{n,i})(n,\\mathsf{len}(n)))]_n.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{tri}&:=\\Sigma(S),\\qquad\\mathsf{pair}:=[\\mathsf{add}(\\mathsf{tri}(\\mathsf{add}(x,y)),y)]_{x,y},\\\\\n\\mathsf{row}_0&:=[\\Sigma([\\mathsf{mul}(x,\\mathsf{eq}(\\mathsf{pair}(x,y),s))]_{s,x,y})(s,x,S(s))]_{s,x},\\\\\n\\mathsf{row}_1&:=[\\Sigma([\\mathsf{mul}(y,\\mathsf{eq}(\\mathsf{pair}(x,y),s))]_{s,x,y})(s,x,S(s))]_{s,x},\\\\\n\\mathsf{fst}&:=[\\Sigma(\\mathsf{row}_0)(s,S(s))]_s,\\quad\\mathsf{snd}:=[\\Sigma(\\mathsf{row}_1)(s,S(s))]_s,\\\\\n\\mathsf{half}&:=[\\Sigma([\\mathsf{not}(\\mathsf{lt}(n,\\mathsf{mul}(2,S(i))))]_{n,i})(n,S(n))]_n,\\\\\n\\mathsf{odd}&:=[\\mathsf{sub}(n,\\mathsf{mul}(2,\\mathsf{half}(n)))]_n,\\\\\n\\mathsf{di}&:=[\\mathsf{mul}(2,n)]_n,\\quad\\mathsf{ri}:=[S(\\mathsf{mul}(2,\\mathsf{pair}(n,m)))]_{n,m},\\\\\n\\mathsf{lookup}&:=[\\mathsf{pred}(\\mathsf{val}(b,\\mathsf{prime}(j)))]_{b,j},\\\\\n\\mathsf{allchild}&:=[\\Pi([\\mathsf{lookup}(b,\\mathsf{di}(\\mathsf{child}(n,i)))]_{n,b,i})(n,b,\\mathsf{len}(n))]_{n,b},\\\\\n\\mathsf{ordered}&:=[\\Pi([\\mathsf{not}(\\mathsf{lookup}(b,\\mathsf{ri}(\\mathsf{child}(n,i),\\mathsf{child}(n,S(i)))))]_{n,b,i})(n,b,\\mathsf{pred}(\\mathsf{len}(n)))]_{n,b},\\\\\n\\mathsf{ds}&:=[\\mathsf{mul}(\\mathsf{shape}(n),\\mathsf{mul}(\\mathsf{allchild}(n,b),\\mathsf{ordered}(n,b)))]_{n,b},\\\\\n\\mathsf{pref}&:=[\\Pi([\\mathsf{eq}(\\mathsf{child}(n,i),\\mathsf{child}(m,i))]_{n,m,i})(n,m,k)]_{n,m,k},\\\\\n\\mathsf{diff}&:=[\\mathsf{mul}(\\mathsf{pref}(n,m,i),\\mathsf{lookup}(b,\\mathsf{ri}(\\mathsf{child}(n,i),\\mathsf{child}(m,i))))]_{n,m,b,i},\\\\\n\\mathsf{lex}&:=[\\mathsf{nz}(\\mathsf{add}(\\mathsf{mul}(\\mathsf{lt}(\\mathsf{len}(n),\\mathsf{len}(m)),\\mathsf{pref}(n,m,\\mathsf{len}(n))),\\\\\n&\\hspace{38mm}\\Sigma(\\mathsf{diff})(n,m,b,\\mathsf{min}(\\mathsf{len}(n),\\mathsf{len}(m)))))]_{n,m,b},\\\\\n\\mathsf{rs}&:=[\\mathsf{mul}(\\mathsf{lookup}(b,\\mathsf{di}(n)),\\mathsf{mul}(\\mathsf{lookup}(b,\\mathsf{di}(m)),\\mathsf{lex}(n,m,b)))]_{n,m,b},\\\\\n\\mathsf{step}&:=[\\mathsf{if}(\\mathsf{odd}(k),\\mathsf{rs}(\\mathsf{fst}(\\mathsf{half}(k)),\\mathsf{snd}(\\mathsf{half}(k)),b),\\mathsf{ds}(\\mathsf{half}(k),b))]_{k,b},\\\\\n\\mathsf{state}&:=\\operatorname{Rec}(0,K(0,1),[\\mathsf{mul}(b,\\mathsf{pow}(\\mathsf{prime}(k),S(\\mathsf{step}(k,b))))]_{k,b}),\\\\\n\\mathsf{bit}&:=[\\mathsf{step}(k,\\mathsf{state}(k))]_k,\\qquad d_\\varepsilon:=[\\mathsf{bit}(\\mathsf{di}(n))]_n,\\qquad r_\\varepsilon:=[\\mathsf{bit}(\\mathsf{ri}(n,m))]_{n,m},\\\\\ne_\\varepsilon&:=\\langle d_\\varepsilon,r_\\varepsilon\\rangle,\\qquad d_{<a}:=[\\mathsf{mul}(d_\\varepsilon(n),r_\\varepsilon(n,\\underline{c(a)}))]_n,\\qquad e_{<a}:=\\langle d_{<a},r_\\varepsilon\\rangle\\quad(a\\in\\operatorname{OT}_{\\varepsilon_0}).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{ar}(d_\\varepsilon)&=\\operatorname{ar}(d_{<a})=1,\\qquad\\operatorname{ar}(r_\\varepsilon)=2,\\\\\n\\forall n\\in\\omega\\quad⟦ d_\\varepsilon⟧(n)&=\\mathbf1_{n\\in D_\\varepsilon},\\\\\n\\forall n,m\\in\\omega\\quad⟦ r_\\varepsilon⟧(n,m)&=\\mathbf1_{\\langle n,m\\rangle\\in R_\\varepsilon},\\\\\n\\forall a\\in\\operatorname{OT}_{\\varepsilon_0}\\ \\forall n\\in\\omega\\quad⟦ d_{<a}⟧(n)&=\\mathbf1_{\\exists b\\in\\operatorname{OT}_{\\varepsilon_0}\\ (n=c(b)\\land b\\triangleleft a)}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":10150,"backlinks":[{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-166","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-df-epsilon-0-notation|df epsilon 0 notation]]"},{"id":"1c3ecb3059f70f57","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$e\\in\\mathsf{RO}$，$e_\\varepsilon$ 为 [[72-df-epsilon-0-notation]] 的固定PR表示，$\\operatorname{TI}_e(A)$ 见 [[72-df-recursive-order-presentation]]，对数公式该构造也为数公式。"},{"id":"2e1cc33090ad6f68","anchor":"ref-12","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-df-epsilon-0-notation]]"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-166","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./72-df-epsilon-0-notation|df epsilon 0 notation]]"},{"id":"3e21ee2923aace9a","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{OT}_{\\varepsilon_0},\\triangleleft,v,c,D_\\varepsilon,R_\\varepsilon$ 如 [[72-df-epsilon-0-notation]]。"},{"id":"6b40e3ecfaa895b6","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$(D_\\varepsilon,R_\\varepsilon)$ 如 [[72-df-epsilon-0-notation]]，$\\mathrm{Acc}_R$ 为 [[72-df-accessible-ordinal]] 的最小前驱闭包。"},{"id":"76fae203d87d09fc","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"固定 [[72-df-epsilon-0-notation]] 的PR程序表示 $e_\\varepsilon$。对固定 $a\\in\\operatorname{OT}_{\\varepsilon_0}$，$e_{<a}$ 取同一节点 Assertion 中的显式程序对，不按外延相等自行更换程序。$\\operatorname{TI}_{e_{<a}}(A)$ 取 [[72-df-recursive-order-presentation]]。"},{"id":"f6f38fb4ec14b41d","anchor":"ref-12","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../72-df-epsilon-0-notation]]"},{"id":"29de2a641cbd0b98","anchor":"ref-54","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../72-df-epsilon-0-notation|72-df-epsilon-0-notation]]"}],"outgoing":["446dc4361d624e0f","eaeefe0a6812ba97","1a814f5220a079de"]}